("Ledger close to breakwaters and points, especially at night in summer and autumn. Groundbait with crushed sardine.","Pridnena montaža uz lukobrane i rtove, osobito noću ljeti i u jesen. Primamite zdrobljenom srdelom.","Pridnena montaža ob valobranih in rtičih, zlasti ponoči poleti in jeseni. Vabite z zdrobljeno sardelo."),
("Small crab","Mali rak","Majhen rak"),
("Hook #2–1/0","Udica #2–1/0","Trnek #2–1/0"),
("For bigger fratar: fish it tight to the rocks and lift steadily so they can't run you into cover.","Za veće fratre: lovite tik uz stijene i ravnomjerno dižite da vam ne pobjegnu u zaklon.","Za večje šarge: lovite tik ob skalah in enakomerno dvigujte, da vam ne pobegnejo v zavetje."),
("0.20–0.25 mm fluorocarbon leader. Minimum size 18 cm.","Fluorokarbonski predvez 0,20–0,25 mm. Minimalna veličina 18 cm.","Fluorokarbonska predvrvica 0,20–0,25 mm. Najmanjša velikost 18 cm."),
