("Hook #10–#12","Udica #10–#12","Trnek #10–#12"),
("Fish it on the drop under a light float along harbour walls and moorings.","Lovite u padanju ispod laganog plovka uz lučke zidove i vezove.","Lovite med padanjem pod lahkim plovcem ob pristaniških zidovih in privezih."),
("Bread paste","Tijesto od kruha","Testo iz kruha"),
("Hook #12","Udica #12","Trnek #12"),
("Simple and effective in harbours on calm days, with a bit of bread groundbait.","Jednostavno i učinkovito u lukama za mirnih dana, uz malo primame od kruha.","Preprosto in učinkovito v pristaniščih ob mirnih dneh, z malo kruha za vabljenje."),
("0.14–0.18 mm leader and a light rod. Groundbait with crushed sardine or bread. Minimum size 12 cm.","Predvez 0,14–0,18 mm i lagani štap. Primamite zdrobljenom srdelom ili kruhom. Minimalna veličina 12 cm.","Predvrvica 0,14–0,18 mm in lahka palica. Vabite z zdrobljeno sardelo ali kruhom. Najmanjša velikost 12 cm."),
("Squid strips","Trake lignje","Trakovi lignja"),
