("Small slow jig or inchiku","Mali spori jig ili inchiku","Majhen počasni jig ali inchiku"),
("Gentle lifts close to the bottom; ribon peck rather than slam it.","Nježna podizanja blizu dna; ribon kljuca, ne udara snažno.","Nežni dvigi blizu dna; ribon kljuva, ne napade sunkovito."),
("0.25–0.30 mm main line with 0.20–0.25 mm snoods. Minimum size 15 cm.","Glavni najlon 0,25–0,30 mm s predvezima 0,20–0,25 mm. Minimalna veličina 15 cm.","Glavna vrvica 0,25–0,30 mm s stranskimi predvrvicami 0,20–0,25 mm. Najmanjša velikost 15 cm."),
("Sardine strips","Trake srdele","Trakovi sardele"),
("2-hook bottom rig, #1–1/0","Pridnena montaža s 2 udice, #1–1/0","Pridnena montaža z 2 trnkoma, #1–1/0"),
("Anchor or drift at dusk and after dark in the deepest water. Hake bite best in the first hours of darkness.","Usidrite se ili driftajte u sumrak i nakon mraka na najdubljoj vodi. Oslić najbolje grize u prvim satima mraka.","Zasidrajte se ali driftajte ob mraku in po njem v najglobljem delu. Oslič najbolje prijemlje v prvih urah teme."),
("Slow jig","Spori jig","Počasni jig"),
("Work it slowly just off the bottom at night.","Noću ga vodite polako tik iznad dna.","Ponoči ga vodite počasi tik nad dnom."),
("Small whole fish (girica, sardine)","Mala cijela riba (girica, srdela)","Majhna cela riba (girica, sardela)"),
("Hook 1/0–2/0","Udica 1/0–2/0","Trnek 1/0–2/0"),
("Bottom rig in the channel on winter nights.","Pridnena montaža u kanalu za zimskih noći.","Pridnena montaža v kanalu v zimskih nočeh."),
("0.35–0.40 mm leader: hake have needle teeth. This is boat fishing; there are few hake inside 20 m.","Predvez 0,35–0,40 mm: oslić ima zube poput igala. Ovo je ribolov iz broda; unutar 20 m oslića je malo.","Predvrvica 0,35–0,40 mm: oslič ima zobe kot igle. To je ribolov s čolna; plitveje od 20 m je osličev malo."),
("Squid jig (egi)","Kalamarara (egi)","Vaba za lignje (egi)"),
("Size 2.5–3.0","Veličina 2,5–3,0","Velikost 2,5–3,0"),
("Cast, count it down close to the seagrass, give 2–3 sharp lifts, then let it glide and sink for 5–10 seconds. Squid grab it on the fall.","Bacite, pustite da potone blizu morske trave, dajte 2–3 oštra podizanja, zatim pustite da klizi i tone 5–10 sekundi. Lignje je hvataju dok pada.","Vrzite, pustite, da potone blizu morske trave, 2–3-krat ostro dvignite, nato pustite, da drsi in tone 5–10 sekund. Lignji jo zgrabijo med padanjem."),
("Float jig with sardine (totanara)","Totanara sa srdelom ispod plovka","Totanara s sardelo pod plovcem"),
("Small luminous jig, sardine tied on","Mala svjetleća totanara, privezana srdela","Majhna svetleča totanara, privezana sardela"),
("At night under harbour and marina lights: let it drift slowly at 2–4 m.","Noću ispod svjetala luke i marine: pustite da polako pluta na 2–4 m.","Ponoči pod lučmi pristanišča in marine: pustite, da počasi plava na 2–4 m."),
("Small egi from the boat","Mala kalamarara iz broda","Majhna vaba egi s čolna"),
("Size 2.0–2.5, with a 10–20 g sinker","Veličina 2,0–2,5, s olovom 10–20 g","Velikost 2,0–2,5, z obtežilnikom 10–20 g"),
("Drift over 8–15 m seagrass at dusk, jigging gently.","U sumrak driftajte iznad morske trave na 8–15 m uz nježno trzanje.","Ob mraku driftajte nad morsko travo na 8–15 m in nežno jigirajte."),
("Light spinning rod, 0.10–0.14 mm braid and a 0.20–0.25 mm fluorocarbon leader. Squid bite best just after sunset.","Lagani spinning štap, upredenica 0,10–0,14 mm i fluorokarbonski predvez 0,20–0,25 mm. Lignje najbolje grizu odmah nakon zalaska sunca.","Lahka spinning palica, pletenica 0,10–0,14 mm in fluorokarbonska predvrvica 0,20–0,25 mm. Lignji najbolje prijemljejo takoj po sončnem zahodu."),
("Squid / cuttlefish jig (egi)","Kalamarara za lignje / sipe (egi)","Vaba za lignje / sipe (egi)"),
("Size 2.5–3.5, heavier model","Veličina 2,5–3,5, teži model","Velikost 2,5–3,5, težji model"),
("Cast and let it sink to the bottom, then drag and hop it slowly over sand and seagrass with long pauses. Cuttlefish follow and grab it while it sits still.","Bacite i pustite da potone do dna, zatim je polako vucite i podižite preko pijeska i morske trave uz duge pauze. Sipa je prati i zgrabi dok miruje.","Vrzite in pustite, da potone do dna, nato jo počasi vlecite in poskakujte čez pesek in morsko travo z dolgimi premori. Sipa ji sledi in jo zgrabi, ko miruje."),
("Small dead fish on a cuttlefish rig","Mala mrtva riba na montaži za sipe","Majhna mrtva riba na montaži za sipe"),
("Girica or sardine on a spiked jig","Girica ili srdela na sipari s iglama","Girica ali sardela na vabi z iglami"),
("Drift it slowly along the bottom from the shore or a boat.","Polako je vucite po dnu s obale ili iz broda.","Počasi jo vlecite po dnu z obale ali s čolna."),
("Egi under a float","Kalamarara ispod plovka","Egi pod plovcem"),
("Size 2.0–2.5","Veličina 2,0–2,5","Velikost 2,0–2,5"),
("In spring, over shallow seagrass where cuttlefish come in to lay eggs.","U proljeće, iznad plitke morske trave kamo sipe dolaze polagati jaja.","Spomladi, nad plitvo morsko travo, kamor sipe prihajajo odlagat jajca."),
("Light rod and soft action: cuttlefish let go if you pull hard. Best in spring and again in autumn.","Lagani štap mekane akcije: sipa pušta ako jako vučete. Najbolje u proljeće i ponovno u jesen.","Lahka palica z mehko akcijo: sipa izpusti, če močno vlečete. Najboljše spomladi in znova jeseni."),
