("Deep-diving minnow","Duboko ronilački wobler","Globoko potapljajoči wobler"),
("14–18 cm, dives 3–5 m","14–18 cm, roni 3–5 m","14–18 cm, potopi se 3–5 m"),
("Run baits 20–40 m back along the 4–10 m line, past points, the river mouth and harbour entrances, at dawn and dusk. Leerfish follow a long way: when the rod bends don't speed up, give it 5 seconds.","U zoru i sumrak vucite mamce 20–40 m iza broda uz liniju od 4–10 m, pokraj rtova, ušća i ulaza u luke. Lica dugo prati: kad se štap savije, ne ubrzavajte, pričekajte 5 sekundi.","Ob zori in mraku vlecite vabe 20–40 m za čolnom ob liniji 4–10 m, mimo rtičev, ustja in vhodov v pristanišča. Lica dolgo sledi: ko se palica upogne, ne pospešujte, počakajte 5 sekund."),
("50–60 lb fluorocarbon leader and 30–50 lb braid.","Fluorokarbonski predvez 50–60 lb i upredenica 30–50 lb.","Fluorokarbonska predvrvica 50–60 lb in pletenica 30–50 lb."),
("12–14 cm, dives 0.5–1.5 m","12–14 cm, roni 0,5–1,5 m","12–14 cm, potopi se 0,5–1,5 m"),
("Live mullet or shrimp","Živi cipal ili kozica","Živ cipelj ali kozica"),
("slow-trolled close to the rocks","sporo panulanje blizu stijena","počasno vlečenje blizu skal"),
("Troll very close (20–50 m) to rocky points and white water at first light, and along the river mouth edge on the ebb. Rough, stained days are best.","U zoru panulajte vrlo blizu (20–50 m) stjenovitih rtova i pjene, a za oseke uz rub ušća. Najbolji su valoviti dani sa zamućenom vodom.","Ob zori vlecite zelo blizu (20–50 m) skalnatih rtičev in peneče vode, ob oseki pa ob robu ustja. Najboljši so razburkani dnevi z motno vodo."),
("25–30 lb fluorocarbon leader.","Fluorokarbonski predvez 25–30 lb.","Fluorokarbonska predvrvica 25–30 lb."),
("2-hook rig, 1–3 m off the bottom","Montaža s 2 udice, 1–3 m iznad dna","Montaža z 2 trnkoma, 1–3 m nad dnom"),
("15–20 cm, dives 10–20 m","15–20 cm, roni 10–20 m","15–20 cm, potopi se 10–20 m"),
("Follow the drop-off at 15–25 m at first light, with a downrigger or a 200–500 g trolling lead keeping the bait just above the rocks.","U zoru pratite padinu na 15–25 m, s downriggerom ili olovom od 200–500 g koje drži mamac tik iznad stijena.","Ob zori sledite strmini na 15–25 m, z downriggerjem ali svincem 200–500 g, ki drži vabo tik nad skalami."),
("40–60 lb fluorocarbon leader.","Fluorokarbonski predvez 40–60 lb.","Fluorokarbonska predvrvica 40–60 lb."),
("Small feathers / squid skirts","Malo perje / lignjice","Majhno perje / lignjice"),
("5–8 cm, single or a daisy chain of 2","5–8 cm, pojedinačno ili niz od 2","5–8 cm, posamično ali niz dveh"),
("30–50 m behind the boat, in or just outside the propeller wash. Steer for birds and bait breaking the surface, and cut across the edge of the school rather than through it.","30–50 m iza broda, u brazdi propelera ili tik izvan nje. Vozite prema pticama i sitnoj ribi na površini i presijecite rub jata, ne prolazite kroz njega.","30–50 m za čolnom, v brazdi propelerja ali tik zunaj nje. Usmerite se proti pticam in drobni ribi na površju ter prečkajte rob jate, ne pojdite skozi njo."),
("0.40–0.50 mm fluorocarbon leader, 3–5 m long.","Fluorokarbonski predvez 0,40–0,50 mm, dužine 3–5 m.","Fluorokarbonska predvrvica 0,40–0,50 mm, dolžine 3–5 m."),
("1–2 kn with live bait, 4–6 kn with lures","1–2 čv sa živim mamcem, 4–6 čv s varalicama","1–2 vozla z živo vabo, 4–6 vozlov z umetnimi vabami"),
("Live garfish, mackerel or squid","Živa iglica, skuša ili lignja","Živa iglica, skuša ali ligenj"),
("bridled on a 4/0–6/0 circle hook, 5–15 m down","na omči s circle udicom 4/0–6/0, 5–15 m dubine","na zanki s krožnim trnkom 4/0–6/0, 5–15 m globoko"),
("15–20 cm, dives 8–15 m","15–20 cm, roni 8–15 m","15–20 cm, potopi se 8–15 m"),
("10–15 cm","10–15 cm","10–15 cm"),
("Work the drop-off and isolated rocks at 15–30 m at first light, and pass close to buoys, mussel farms and floating objects. When a gof hooks up, steer away from the rocks straight away.","U zoru lovite padinu i usamljene hridi na 15–30 m i prolazite blizu bova, uzgajališta dagnji i plutajućih predmeta. Kad se gof zakači, odmah skrenite od stijena.","Ob zori lovite na strmini in osamljenih čereh na 15–30 m ter plujte blizu boj, gojišč školjk in plavajočih predmetov. Ko se gof zatakne, takoj zavijte stran od skal."),
("60–80 lb fluorocarbon leader and a strong drag.","Fluorokarbonski predvez 60–80 lb i jaka kočnica.","Fluorokarbonska predvrvica 60–80 lb in močna zavora."),
("not trolled","ne lovi se panulom","ne lovi se s panulo"),
("Hake aren't caught trolling. They live on the bottom, mostly deeper than 40 m, and only a few come into the 20–25 m channel on winter nights. Anchor or drift there after dark with sardine strips on a 2-hook bottom rig.","Oslić se ne lovi panulom. Živi na dnu, uglavnom dublje od 40 m, a tek poneki zimskih noći uđe u kanal od 20–25 m. Ondje se nakon mraka usidrite ili driftajte s trakama srdele na pridnenoj montaži s 2 udice.","Osliča ne lovimo s panulo. Živi na dnu, večinoma globlje od 40 m, in le redki v zimskih nočeh pridejo v kanal na 20–25 m. Tam se po mraku zasidrajte ali driftajte s trakovi sardele na pridneni montaži z 2 trnkoma."),
("0.35–0.40 mm leader.","Predvez 0,35–0,40 mm.","Predvrvica 0,35–0,40 mm."),
("3–5 kn","3–5 čv","3–5 vozlov"),("2–3 kn","2–3 čv","2–3 vozle"),("1–2 kn","1–2 čv","1–2 vozla"),("4–6 kn","4–6 čv","4–6 vozlov"),
("Inshore line: Mirna plume to Kostanjija","Obalna linija: od riječne vode Mirne do Kostanjije","Obalna linija: od rečne vode Mirne do Kostanjije"),
("Inshore line","Obalna linija","Obalna linija"),
("Along the edge of the river plume, past Rt Sv. Petar and the Novigrad breakwater, then up the rocky coast to Rt Štrunac. Stay 100–200 m off the rocks.","Uz rub riječne vode, pokraj rta Sv. Petar i novigradskog lukobrana, zatim uz stjenovitu obalu do rta Štrunac. Držite se 100–200 m od stijena.","Ob robu rečne vode, mimo rta Sv. Petar in novigrajskega valobrana, nato ob skalnati obali do rta Štrunac. Držite se 100–200 m od skal."),
("Tarska bay mouth: Rt Zub to Rt Kras","Ulaz u Tarsku uvalu: od rta Zub do rta Kras","Vhod v Tarsko uvalo: od rta Zub do rta Kras"),
("Tarska bay mouth","Ulaz u Tarsku uvalu","Vhod v Tarsko uvalo"),
("Across the south side of the bay mouth where the slope drops off. Good on the ebb when river water flows out.","Preko južne strane ulaza u uvalu gdje dno naglo pada. Dobro za oseke kad riječna voda istječe.","Čez južno stran vhoda v zaliv, kjer dno strmo pade. Dobro ob oseki, ko rečna voda odteka."),
("Outer line off Novigrad","Vanjska linija ispred Novigrada","Zunanja linija pred Novigradom"),
("The 15–22 m line about 1.5 km off the coast, where bonito schools travel along the shore in autumn.","Linija od 15–22 m oko 1,5 km od obale, kuda u jesen uz obalu putuju jata palamida.","Linija 15–22 m okoli 1,5 km od obale, kjer jeseni ob obali potujejo jate palamid."),
("Červar inshore: Lanterna to Šilok","Obala Červara: od Lanterne do Šiloka","Obala Červarja: od Lanterne do Šiloka"),
("Červar inshore","Obala Červara","Obala Červarja"),
("Past Valetica, Rt Razba, the mouth of Luka Červar, Mali Školj, the Mrčana coves and Rt Busuja, about 100–250 m off the rocks.","Pokraj Valetice, rta Razba, ulaza u Luku Červar, Malog Školja, uvala Mrčana i rta Busuja, oko 100–250 m od stijena.","Mimo Valetice, rta Razba, vhoda v Luko Červar, Malega Školja, zalivčkov Mrčana in rta Busuja, okoli 100–250 m od skal."),
("Červar plateau edge","Rub červarskog platoa","Rob červarske planote"),
("Where the 12–16 m plateau starts to drop off, about 1 km out. Dentex and bonito follow this edge at first light.","Gdje plato od 12–16 m počinje padati, oko 1 km od obale. Zubaci i palamide u zoru prate ovaj rub.","Kjer planota 12–16 m začne padati, okoli 1 km od obale. Zobatci in palamide ob zori sledijo temu robu."),
("Offshore Červar","Pučina ispred Červara","Odprto morje pred Červarjem"),
("The open 20–25 m water about 2.5 km out, for bonito schools in autumn.","Otvoreno more od 20–25 m oko 2,5 km od obale, za jata palamida u jesen.","Odprto morje 20–25 m okoli 2,5 km od obale, za jate palamid jeseni."),
("Poreč inshore: Rt Materada to Funtana","Obala Poreča: od rta Materada do Funtane","Obala Poreča: od rta Materada do Funtane"),
("Poreč inshore","Obala Poreča","Obala Poreča"),
("Past Rt Sv. Martin, outside Sv. Nikola island, along Brulo and Plava Laguna and round the Zelena Laguna islets to Funtana. Keep clear of the swimming zones off the beaches.","Pokraj rta Sv. Martin, s vanjske strane otoka Sv. Nikola, uz Brulo i Plavu Lagunu te oko otočića Zelene Lagune do Funtane. Izbjegavajte kupališne zone ispred plaža.","Mimo rta Sv. Martin, z zunanje strani otoka Sv. Nikola, ob Brulu in Plavi Laguni ter okoli otočkov Zelene Lagune do Funtane. Izogibajte se kopalnim območjem pred plažami."),
("Poreč plateau edge","Rub porečkog platoa","Rob poreške planote"),
("The 12–16 m edge about 1–1.5 km off the coast, outside the islets. Dentex and bonito follow it at first light.","Rub od 12–16 m oko 1–1,5 km od obale, s vanjske strane otočića. Zubaci i palamide u zoru ga prate.","Rob 12–16 m okoli 1–1,5 km od obale, zunaj otočkov. Zobatci in palamide mu ob zori sledijo."),
("Offshore Poreč","Pučina ispred Poreča","Odprto morje pred Porečem"),
("Open 20–26 m water 2–3 km out, where bonito schools pass in autumn.","Otvoreno more od 20–26 m, 2–3 km od obale, kuda u jesen prolaze jata palamida.","Odprto morje 20–26 m, 2–3 km od obale, kjer jeseni plavajo jate palamid."),
